json for actual fail events\n163|  and log hashes; producer-mutant-audit.json preserves command/exit metadata.\n164|\n165|## Preservation and provenance\n166|\n167|RPC backup hashes: 15/15; parked RPC hashes: 11/11, unchanged. There is **one\n168|literal changed-path overlap: README.md** (already present in CR10); no RPC\n169|implementation-path overlap. The requested literal zero-overlap claim would be\n170|false, so it is not made. This leaf's README change describes host credentials,\n171|Config4 and tooling; the original RPC README bytes remain preserved in backup.\n172|All 74 candidate delta files match the immutable tree after probes were removed.\n173|SSH and peer checkpoint directory comparisons against their prior checkpoint\n174|remain unchanged (apart from this leaf's added v4 interoperability test).\n175|Both ef0b63b and 3058751 signatures verify against the configured author key.\n176|Pinned spec source document hash matches commit\n177|0cbdf100dbf84df50c64f792b1f940e3a67859a6.\n178|\n179|Tool-readiness/operational anomalies: project-local skill directories are absent\n180|inside this archived/worktree layout; the Curator-managed Go skill was read from\n181|the canonical main repository. Initial unsupported resources() query was replaced\n182|by the documented scoped get projection. One reviewer scratch-file write used a\n183|wrong relative path and failed; its resulting no-test run is not evidence. The\n184|corrected probe was rerun and its actual failure retained. Directives reads\n185|succeeded with none recorded. No unchanged handoff retry or source repair was\n186|attempted by this reviewer.\n187|\n188|## Verdict routing\n189|\n190|Changes requested, route to **to-dev**, not blocked and not accepted. Reopen\n191|checklist items 6, 11, 12 and 18: full acceptance, negative coverage, narrowing\n192|coverage and implementation match are not true while these counterexamples\n193|remain. Retain passed tests and explicit bounds; repair F1/F2 and the evidence\n194|attachment/hygiene issues in the next producer candidate. No accept_cr,\n195|commit_ack, producer checkpoint, commit, or trunk integration was performed.","final_result":true}}}
